                                                "sense_id": "9504f5ce-275d-30a4-af3a-ef9071576ae4",
                                                "text": "Calvin could be anywhere in this zoo. I hope he at least has the sense to stay put, wherever he is. Where would the little rotter go if he was lost and separated from his stuffed toy?"
